      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d94f76a208fc818554b399be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "枠号为7时稍微会有好事发生",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e30c993b4eec17b3f463bfecf7e8c13eff2458841a15899d6df37eacf04fdae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201562"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4fcd9ce5b26f58cc96d65fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "距离终点777m的时候,可以略微打起精神",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd4e16a6bc2a1499d24ed71efff3f3b82772d3df48b871316677a6fe7a51b57",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cdb64d836bc71c18dbc4c91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "略微擅长上坡",
      "source_fingerprint": "99cd277281b113fadbbaed8b50f9970e69fb3d077e7330f106f42b3e7d4588cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:386e903da502ffb18784732d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "上坡时加速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b5e78e43f3076ce2fb6ef65890a9825edc0741426cdc45a37320ebf8a183a19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201582"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12097c2c524cebb5efd1d848",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "附近有多个马娘时,略微加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "00795fe2a6866a4bfb94412bee0d225bf5feac57084ee077102481bbabadf383",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edbe50850e209e2111932940",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "附近有多个马娘时,加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "05a36ecd6b7c14ef76595da441abe2cbb35be4859cb1c16ba036811ea8e5a244",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201592"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d7a3103b26caed74244217",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛初期发动多个技能时\\n加速度略微提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "87fb565bc474de4cc4f5bcdb346d12d380c17775a25f6cecfa09142c8efbaaff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b6692845f4b32cbf187a452",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛初期发动多个技能时\\n加速度提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "5303764db17e38e58f5444ab91e9514d4f46c15f25ee6efdedaef269f93cc2b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201602"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2875fbaa769076fe9cfa0a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘发动多个技能时\\n速度略微提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "b706129840d3d4e8dad936e943d0be33f9e864799463396d23129419970bfe7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc1efdc0e144ba5abfe90f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘发动多个技能时\\n速度提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbc29f90236016ef66fec6942a268a2aee88e0ae2f39d62326295f08c4a0058c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201612"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:365341ac16b256cee60168bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘发动多个技能时\\n耐力略微回复",
      "source_fingerprint": "5827c9dd92ce82909b1e8e5fe80789ff865c13c7cda68fa6e5673bf7f2647338",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201621"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07897bb131e1f20d1016115e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中有很多持有「同理心」的马娘\\n则自己速度少许上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "87b535dfb87678ddd89794a3a2eb5ee46ebaec51cb06cb65497035f61714d070",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201631"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a86eb44204c153d60323b1c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛里有马娘持有「同理心」技能\\n则提升速度\\n并使全员持有的「同理心」\\n无视条件直接发动＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc3adb9e129b39555986b62fc062c8a8e1aacdfe2ed746fc1d969aad78166cdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201632"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47a1414099cf4d686e000a00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中只有自己持有「单枪匹马」技能时\\n速度少许上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "90fdca2f0bfc53c4eaaebf974c9759dd269bab021f33777ae1b05e74cf34f09a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201641"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7689a576b88ad713016d01f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跑位贴紧前方马娘时\\n略微减少自身所承受的阻力",
      "source_fingerprint": "3977057a259e6683a30cbeb35b05a5f9a3749799dd9011592b58d6bac65f78d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46897a3386befd23f3752244",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跑位贴紧前方马娘时\\n减少自身所承受的阻力",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ee74d5158490a121602ababc7edae53e6e72ae712314dddfe2671af6862787",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201652"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9783f921e172db81ce19a1dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "长时间有紧跟在自己身后的马娘\\n则速度略微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "1391cf3a99a71656103c841589eedf89ced36378a26a5d10ff900efa8bbf8427",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe7640d432f4ced4791ed1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身后有马娘长时间紧追的话\\n将会提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "acb6018f9b6e30f6fe09dffb6d8f9e3a1a0fa3e9836a95add12a5eb313d93cee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201662"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08c0ef4e58b62283bad6bcf2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘进行名次争夺时\\n速度上升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b5d33595db7048ed8cbbdc90293fc6f2b9e9a6fda5282544086e63404b6ea6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd9bc15400d3603ba07e3313",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘进行名次争夺时\\n速度略微上升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7109e8a5db488eb023379f8f94f0449b7c39041a6e35764c6ae85ce7f96278c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201672"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82bbb0074978cc797e1d6222",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘采取向前冲刺\\n的姿势＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d602773786ed8735d0ce52c6b5572e4326583eda53e73b1c7c113eef2b3c4451",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8650b72fd378394e013105",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赛程终盘略微冲刺\\n调整姿态＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0e9dab07ee44da15a6d39d30f059d562283a62a920d4282c288c4d1ac0fd24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201682"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23762200146d3fd84e06b637",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛临近中盘时\\n若位于中团以后的位置\\n恢复持久力＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee2463e03c42f8b78776d2f23989649aa137c089343a6aa403c5b8da31319f99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722f515332c2ecb44da34c07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛临近中盘时\\n若位于中团以后的位置\\n稍微恢复持久力＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf85ccf5b82c505056b6447d9a78ac0d28941df0ef31d3f6b07b6babcf5ebf98",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201692"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c22d739aa313504867ffca3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线若处于好位置\\n则提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7096734fddbe8aaeb0f1cc07a295caa41d0bff50fbb65bd0e556a7c17016f83d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cdb2bf3420a4e5163ec1d43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线若处于好位置\\n则稍微提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b944b775f187f72ca4a9ccda50daa7032028c22441e8ae7167671ebf7cdbfa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201702"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18d0f688b6997593051698df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "稍微不擅长「良」的马场状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a935afbd3d3bb70708095c38f5fd5a9af0ba7859dac5078b8b14b780370ab74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201801"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47973ec72137387b87c7a777",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若位于前方\\n提升加速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2d9465ebf646032c0cc2741b385667f4689b9b9f74cd75eb5410a08a40b5f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201901"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:babb1144c91316816224ac32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若位于前方\\n稍微提升加速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9759a7f1b2f24e64205e4923d4a298baa3dd8bbafc28adb57517ce5a007a0f79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "201902"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c79f426b48f14e7be9bf3ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘若位于后方\\n将回复持久力,提升速度＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "02af9e22a7f7947ee3c27c4cf67d77b6e76f089f46abbd091de3079b27288846",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d35821bfb53c9b6e7cd62d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘若处于后方\\n略微回复持久力＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "773922e2da1155e0c0990aef0261bec54de3c36c882819b1b5cda5e021846056",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e76dfe13d893e78d1288cead",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛接近终盘时,处于前方的话\\n会提升速度＜长距离＞",
